// declare global color tracker at top of ink file
VAR text_color = "white" // default text color

->intro

===intro===
# color: white
The Shogunate is weak and decadent. The Shogun, Tokugawa Yoshinobu has demonstrated his inability to protect the people of Japan from the West. 

After a series of capitulations to the foreign powers, it is clear he is no longer fit to rule. As we suffer and starve, the Shogun seeks to divide our nation amongst the Western powers who hungrily eye the Japanese archipelago. 

The Satsuma and Choshu clans, now with the Emperor's backing seek to throw off the Shogunate's yoke. Even now, the Shogunate's allies see the folly of their ways, as day by day the Imperial camp swells with defectors. 

Among these, are the Lords of Yodo and Tsu.
    -> END
